commit 51ca4ff53e732221fa9518be6aa4cd65ea449e25
Author: dowiyogo <dowiyogo@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed May 6 23:20:49 2026 -0400

    fix(optics): add Al-foil reflective surface to wrap (dielectric_metal)
    
    The Mylar-as-dielectric model provided identical optical confinement to a bare bar in air (same TIR critical angle at the bar face). Replace with an explicit G4LogicalBorderSurface(WrapPV -> WorldPV) using dielectric_metal model with spectrally-resolved Al-foil reflectivity R(lambda) = 0.85-0.92.
    
    Also fix geometry bug: remove kMylarThick gap between BarCenter and BarCap sub-volumes (was inserting 50 um of Mylar inside the bar, causing extra Fresnel losses for photons crossing the longitudinal boundaries).
    
    Resolves: photon yield 2-5x below experimental data (Betancourt 2020).

